1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
OBD power for parking monitoring.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:05,400
Use a compatible cable for your dash cam.

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:10,400
Plug it into the OBD-II port beneath the dash.

4
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,400
Take the power lead to your dash cam.

5
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:16,400
Connect the lead to the camera power input.

6
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:21,900
Confirm that the dash cam powers on.

7
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:29,700
With the ignition off, check that recording stays active.
Parking mode depends on camera and vehicle compatibility.
